    <span class="gate"><b>✓ P0 FOUND AND FIXED 2026-09-04 —</b>
    <code>llmproxy.model_authz</code> denied <b>every</b> request in any chain that enabled it,
    a 100% outage that made WP-50 3a/3b-iv non-functional in production (fails closed, so not a
    bypass). It read <code>StreamInfo::requested_model</code> in <code>decode_headers</code>,
    but <code>body_rewrite</code> writes it in <code>decode_data</code> and the filter manager
    runs all header callbacks before any data — a header/data <b>phase</b> mismatch that config
    ordering could never have fixed. Found by the first drill ever to run the admin API against
    the real binary; 18 unit tests had passed because they called <code>decode_headers</code>
    directly. Rule 16, again: a suite that never switches a feature on cannot regress it.</span>
    <b>v0.2.0 "production-ready serving" shipped 2026-08-29</b> and is tagged.
    <b>v0.1.0 "LLM gateway" shipped 2026-08-08</b> and is tagged. <b>v0.0.1 shipped 2026-08-01</b>:
    the live smoke test ran against the real OpenAI and Anthropic endpoints and passed all four
