    the client seeing an error. <b>All three clauses verified end to end, against mock upstreams —
    not against real providers.</b> Token counts + TTFT/TPOT: QA-1 and QA-10, against a mock with
    known pacing (observed ttft=402ms/tpot=122.129ms/max_stall=152ms in the actual access log).
    Provider failover (WP-35): <code>testing/diffrig/tests/failover_e2e.rs</code> drives the real
    binary against a real dialect config and a mock forced to 429 — exact attempt accounting, the
