    proven over a real socket; increment 3 (2026-09-07) wired <code>/ready</code> to gate on
    cluster warming, giving <code>is_initialized</code> its first production caller — though the
    deadline only stops warming from gating readiness, it never marks a cluster initialized.
    <b>WP-58 (2026-09-08) gave it a second caller</b>: <code>router.rs</code> now checks
    <code>is_initialized</code> before routing, so a not-yet-warm cluster fails distinctly
    (<code>cluster_not_warmed</code>) instead of through the generic ejected-hosts path — this is
