    complete 2026-09-08</b> — a direct safety consequence of this gate's own subject (a fast CDS
    heartbeat would otherwise clear ejection state proxy-wide on a timer) but not itself a gate
    requirement. WP-20 is done; WP-21 and WP-22 remain started, WP-28 is scaffolding only.</span>
    <span class="sub"><b>The honest read on v0.1.0:</b> all three gate clauses are proven against
    mocks that were built to exercise exactly these failure paths (a forced 429, an exhausted
    budget) — arguably a better instrument than an on-demand real-provider drill for those two, but
