    <b>Re-measured 2026-08-09 via <code>make tq-count</code>: 1130 tests passed, 24 skipped</b>
    — the skip count is unchanged and the increase is explained by that day's new test files
    (<code>reload.rs</code>, <code>stats_e2e.rs</code>, <code>swap_under_load.rs</code>, an
