    <b>A live run against a local Ollama (2026-08-14) found two real defects that 1141 passing
    tests had not</b> — the same lesson WP-41's QA suite already taught, found again outside it.
    One is fixed: a successful content-length-framed 200 was logged
    <code>response_flags: DC</code>, because hyper stops polling the body once the declared
