    <code>SECURITY.md</code>'s reporting contact still unfilled.
    <b>Test count reconciled this refresh: 1146 tests passed, 24 skipped</b> — re-run directly
    via <code>make tq-count</code>, plus <code>cargo fmt --check</code>,
    <code>cargo clippy -D warnings</code>, <code>make tq-doc</code>, and <code>make qa</code> all
